 "remarks": "NOW OFFERING 1 MONTH FREE WITH A ONE-YEAR LEASE! Discover our largest single-level, 3-bedroom residence at The Wilton Center Lofts, offering an impressive 1,771 square feet of thoughtfully designed living space, 3 spacious bedrooms, and 2.5 luxurious bathrooms. A standout feature is the HUGE private deck, accessible from both the primary bedroom and main living area, providing exceptional indoor-outdoor living. Designed by award-winning Granoff Architects, this sophisticated residence showcases 9-foot ceilings, oversized windows, beautiful wood-grain flooring, and premium finishes throughout. The gourmet kitchen features quartz countertops, stainless steel BOSCH appliances, custom cabinetry, and elegant fixtures. Generous walk-in closets and an in-unit washer and dryer add everyday convenience. Residents enjoy a fitness center, stylish lounge, covered parking, and available storage. Pet-friendly, too! COMMUTER'S DREAM! Just a 7-minute walk to Metro-North, offering convenient access to NYC and beyond. Experience exceptional space, modern luxury, and sophisticated design in the heart of Wilton Center. Schedule your private tour today!",
